# Monopoly house, toppled: the giant mushroom house (monopoly_house) knocked over onto its side, its roof towards +x. It rests on
# the brim of its cap and on one bottom edge of its walls, so it lies a little tipped up, showing its front door (+z) sideways and
# the cream gills under its eaves.
format 1
collider mesh

# Turned 77° about z, which brings the cap's rim and the walls' bottom edge on that side level with each other, about 1.3 m
# below the house's foot: lifted by that, less a few centimetres sunk into the ground
Translate translation=(0, 1.28, 0)
    Rotate rotation=(0, 0, -1.35)
        Part part=monopoly_house
